#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build / simulation artifacts
#
# Nothing here is source. The `make` flow in the repo root writes everything
# into sim/, and QuestaSim drops its own scratch files next to wherever vsim was
# started. Files already committed under tb_edited/sim/ are the user's own
# debugging artifacts and are intentionally left tracked - this ignore list only
# stops NEW scratch output from being added.
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# root Makefile / scripts output directory
/sim/

# QuestaSim / ModelSim libraries and scratch
work/
**/work/
*.mpf
*.mti
modelsim.ini
transcript
transcript.*
*.wlf
wlft*
vsim_stacktrace.vstf
vish_stacktrace.vstf
*.vstf
voptstacktrace.vstf
_opt/
_opt*/

# logs
*.log
questa_sim.log

# editor / OS scratch
*~
*.bak
*.orig
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# licence-free check tooling (node/python deps stay out of git)
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.yowasp/
/tmp/
